// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// eyu.c 鳄鱼
// By River 99.5.25
#include <ansi.h>
inherit NPC;

void create()
{
        set_name("鳄鱼", ({ "e yu", "e", "yu" }));
        set("race", "野兽");
        set("age", 200);
        set("long", "一条庞大无比鳄鱼，浑身长着像铁甲般的鳞片。\n");
        set("str", 70);
        set("con", 50);
        set("max_qi", 800);
        set("limbs", ({ "头部", "身体", "尾巴", "嘴巴" }));
        set("verbs", ({ "bite" }) );
        set("combat_exp", 300000);
        set_temp("apply/attack", 250);
        set_temp("apply/damage", 250);
        set_temp("apply/armor", 250);
        setup();
}

void init()
{
    object ob;
    ::init();
    if (interactive(ob = this_player())){
           tell_object(ob,HIR"鳄鱼一见你从水中浮出，都张开血盆大口，朝你游了过来。\n"NOR);
           remove_call_out("kill_ob");
           call_out("kill_ob", 1, ob); 
          }
}

void die()
{        
        message_vision("\n左首一条鳄鱼怪嗷一声，一个筋斗翻入渊中。\n", this_object());
        destruct(this_object());
}

void unconcious()
{
        message_vision("\n左首一条鳄鱼怪嗷一声，一个筋斗翻入渊中。\n", this_object());
        destruct(this_object());
}